    <string name="lg_terms_body"># Using RideNow Driver\n\nThese terms describe how drivers may use the RideNow Driver app. Replace this summary with the full terms approved by your legal team.\n\n# Your account\n\nKeep your details accurate, protect your sign-in, and do not let anyone else drive under your account.\n\n# Rides and payments\n\nAccept only rides you can complete safely. Fares, fees and payout timing are shown in the app.</string>
    <string name="lg_privacy_body"># Your data\n\nThis summary explains the kind of data RideNow Driver uses. Replace it with the full policy approved by your legal team.\n\n# What we collect\n\nProfile details, vehicle documents, trip and earnings records, and location while you are online.\n\n# How we use it\n\nTo match you with riders, pay you, keep trips safe and improve the service. You can ask for a copy or deletion from Privacy &amp; Security.</string>
    <string name="lg_cookies_body"># Cookies\n\nThe driver app does not use browser cookies. Our website and help pages may use cookies to remember preferences and measure usage. Replace this summary with your full cookie policy.</string>
    <string name="lg_guidelines_body"># Be respectful\n\nTreat riders and other drivers with courtesy. Discrimination, harassment and threats are not allowed.\n\n# Drive safely\n\nFollow traffic laws, keep your vehicle in good condition and never drive while tired or impaired.\n\n# Be honest\n\nUse accurate documents and do not manipulate fares, ratings or locations.</string>
    <string name="lg_about_body"># Ride, Now.\n\nRideNow connects riders with local drivers quickly and fairly. RideNow Driver gives drivers clear earnings, simple tools and support when they need it.</string>
    <string name="lg_credits_body"># Built with\n\nAndroid, Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.\n\n# Thanks\n\nThanks to the open source community and to every driver who gave us feedback.</string>
    <string name="lg_licenses_body"># Open source\n\nThis app uses AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Material 3 and Kotlin, which are licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Full license texts are available from their projects.</string>
    <string name="lg_company_body"># RideNow\n\nLegal entity, registered address and contact details go here. Replace this text with your company information.</string>
